---
import '../styles/style.css';
import PrismBackground from '../components/PrismBackground.jsx';
import SectionTitle from '../components/SectionTitle.jsx';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Ian Palallos | Creatives</title>
<meta name="description" content="Ian Palallos - video editing, cinematography, and graphic design.">
<link rel="icon" href="/ae.png">
<script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add("js");try{document.documentElement.dataset.theme=localStorage["aeyan-theme"]||"solarized";sessionStorage.seen&&document.documentElement.classList.add("seen","ready")}catch(e){}</script>
</head>
<body>
<div id="loader" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="sun"></div><h2><b class="br">[</b><span>a</span><span>e</span><span class="x">y</span><span class="x">a</span><span class="x">n</span><b class="br">]</b></h2></div>
<div class="progress"></div>
<div class="cursor"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 2l17 8.5-7.2 2.3L9.6 20z"/></svg></div>
<PrismBackground client:load />
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="#" class="logo" aria-label="Back to top"><b>[</b>ae<b>]</b></a>
  <a href="/">Technical</a>
  <a href="/creatives">Creatives</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  <div class="themes"><button data-t="solarized" aria-label="Solarized dark mode" title="Solarized dark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 5.9a3.96 3.96 0 0 0 5.6 5.6 5.6 5.6 0 1 1-5.6-5.6Z"/><path d="M19 4v4M17 6h4M3 20.5h18"/></svg></button><button data-t="light" aria-label="Light mode" title="Light"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41"/></svg></button><button data-t="dark" aria-label="Dark mode" title="Dark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"/></svg></button></div>
</nav>

<section id="home" class="wrap hero">
  <p class="muted"><b>Beyond</b> the terminal</p>
  <div class="hero-row">
    <h1>Creatives <br>&amp; Video Edits</h1>
    <p class="lead">Video editing, cinematography, graphic design, and drawing: the <span class="accent">creative</span> side of my work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="videos" class="wrap block">
  <p class="eyebrow">My edits</p>
  <SectionTitle client:load label="Videos" />
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/npC8ipNO9hE" title="Video 1" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>Project Roleplay | DCPET 1-3 | Group 2</h3><p class="muted">This was one of the first projects I seriously worked on. It was a group project, and I was assigned as the camera operator. All of the framing and composition were based on my ideas. Later, I decided to edit the entire project because I had a vision for how I wanted it to look, and it worked out well. This was the final video that was presented to the class.</p></article>
    <article class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/YO2grRoCs1E" title="Video 2" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>Polytechnic University of the Philippines Logo Intro Animation | Made from DaVinci Resolve</h3><p class="muted">This was the first animation I worked on using Fusion in DaVinci Resolve. I was curious about how the Fusion page worked, so I decided to try animating my university logo and turn it into a cinematic-style intro.</p></article>
    <article class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/sCYnW1UQork" title="Video 3" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>Higuruma vs Yuji X Lunatic Interlude | JJK S3 EP9</h3><p class="muted">I made this anime edit because I was inspired by what I saw on TikTok. I wanted to try editing it with my own vision and creativity. I was also experimenting with color grading while also being experimental.</p></article>
    <article class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/us2BfXDEVBY" title="Video 4" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
      referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe><h3>Yuta vs Uro vs Ryu [But I Made All The SFX From Scratch] + Edit | JJK S3 EP9</h3><p class="muted">This type of edit requires storytelling because you're cutting down an entire episode into a one-minute edit. I also thought, “What if I combine two songs perfectly to add a twist?” Right? So, I remade the SFX from scratch as well, not just a song. It was really fascinating for me to create something that may seem simple, but still has substance and meaning behind the edit.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="wrap block">
  <p class="eyebrow">Let's talk</p>
  <SectionTitle client:load label="Contact" />
  <p class="muted">Have a video or design project in mind? Feel free to reach out.</p>
  <p class="muted">Location: <span class="white">Manila, Philippines</span></p>
  <div class="socials">
    <a href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=palallosianl@gmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span data-icon="gmail"></span><div><b>Gmail</b><small>palallosianl@gmail.com</small></div></a>
    <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/ian-palallos-040763297" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-icon="linkedin"></span><div><b>LinkedIn</b><small>Ian Palallos</small></div></a>
    <!-- EDIT: your GitHub profile link -->
    <a href="https://github.com/aeyan2004" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-icon="github"></span><div><b>GitHub</b><small>Code &amp; projects</small></div></a>
    <!-- EDIT: your Facebook profile link -->
    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/aeyan.p" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-icon="facebook"></span><div><b>Facebook</b><small>Message me</small></div></a>
    <!-- EDIT: your YouTube channel link -->
    <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@IanPalallos" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-icon="youtube"></span><div><b>YouTube</b><small>Video edits</small></div></a>
    <!-- EDIT: your Steam profile link -->
    <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199142297633/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span data-icon="steam"></span><div><b>Steam</b><small>Let's play</small></div></a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="wrap">
  <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> Ian L. Palallos. Design based on DarkMinimal by <a href="https://github.com/Gothsec" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Andres Hernandez</a> (MIT License).</p>
</footer>
<script is:inline src="/scripts/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>